**Grandfathered Lifetime Deal Accounts will be issued automatically and
exclusively to customers who have made at least one purchase between
November 28th 2022- July 19th 2023. **

So, why should you consider becoming a Grandfathered Lifetime Deal
Account Holder?

**Premium Features for Life:**By purchasing credits now, you'll secure
